[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16810.71, "timestamp": "04:40:10", "text": "はぁ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16818.15, "timestamp": "04:40:18", "text": "でも、ネズミの鳴き声はいつも聞こえるんです。何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16820.628, "timestamp": "04:40:20", "text": "一体どういうことだ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16829.75, "timestamp": "04:40:29", "text": "一体何が突然起こったのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16833.03, "timestamp": "04:40:33", "text": "Escキーを押します。何も起こらない。 Alt+Tab または"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16835.43, "timestamp": "04:40:35", "text": "すべてのコントロール、Alt、Delete は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16843.27, "timestamp": "04:40:43", "text": "何も読み込まれていません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16849.83, "timestamp": "04:40:49", "text": "よし、再起動する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16857.27, "timestamp": "04:40:57", "text": "もう一度やり直しましょう。"}]